D5 - TYPOGRAPHY SYSTEM V1
=========================

1. TYPEFACE AND FALLBACKS
-------------------------
Typeface:   Inter
Fallbacks:  system-ui, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif
Why:        Clear, easy-to-read numbers for prices and trip costs.
Licence:    SIL Open Font License, free through Google Fonts.


2. DESIGN SYSTEM STUDIO EXPLORATION
-----------------------------------
Base size:  16px
Scale:      Smaller on mobile, larger on desktop.
clamp():    Used for headings so they resize between mobile and desktop.


4. TEXT STYLES
--------------
Style    Family  Weight  Size (mobile/desktop)  Line height  Use
Price    Inter   700     40 / 48px              110%         Trip cost
H1       Inter   700     28 / 40px              115%         Page titles
H2       Inter   700     22 / 28px              125%         Section headings
H3       Inter   600     18 / 20px              130%         Card titles
Body     Inter   400     16px                   160%         Paragraphs
Small    Inter   400     14px                   150%         Supporting details
Label    Inter   600     14px                   140%         Form labels
Button   Inter   600     16px                   125%         Button text


6. MOBILE TO DESKTOP
--------------------
Example 1 - H1:     28px on mobile, 40px on desktop.
Example 2 - Price:  40px on mobile, 48px on desktop.


7. CLAMP() EXPLAINED
--------------------
font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.44rem + 1.33vw, 2.5rem);

Minimum:   1.75rem (28px), never smaller.
Fluid:     1.44rem + 1.33vw, grows as the screen gets wider.
Maximum:   2.5rem (40px), never bigger.
Use case:  The h1 page title.